Changes from Mole, starting 2026-10-13:
- Ported the Go disk analyzer (cmd/analyze) and status dashboard (cmd/status)
  from macOS to Linux: freedesktop.org Trash, Linux protected paths and
  overview roots, GNU du, xdg-open, sysfs/procfs hardware, GPU, thermal and
  memory-pressure readers, and a GPU card for machines without a battery.
- Replaced the macOS shell commands (clean, uninstall, optimize, purge) with
  new implementations for Arch Linux and CachyOS.
- Renamed the project to nixit and replaced Mole's mascot. "Mole" and its
  logo are trademarks of the Mole project; nixit is not affiliated with or
  endorsed by it.

The git history before 2026-10-13 is Mole's original history, kept for
attribution.

